{"id":"en_foolish-genius","title":"Foolish Genius","titleEn":"Foolish Genius","description":"Flint Jones, once a leading scientist, is reborn in 1988 into a life where he is regarded as a fool. After sitting the CEE, he gains admission to Tsingpek University and starts researching supercomputers. His ex-wife's plotting brings a top student into conflict with him, but Flint refuses to be cowed and strikes back. In the end, his efforts push his country's technology a full century ahead of the rest of the world. Viewers can follow this series and its episodes on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/foolish-genius/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/foolish-genius/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Faceslapping","Rebirth","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dc25a/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_foolish-genius_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dc25a/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_foolish-genius_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dc25a/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_foolish-genius_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dc25a/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_foolish-genius_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dc25a/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_foolish-genius_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"R